{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3741360/extras/Gameplay-1.gif?t=1748287240\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Tiny Vending Machines</strong> is an idle pixel art business sim that runs discreetly at the bottom of your screen while you work, study, or browse. Build your vending empire without interrupting your day!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>How it works:</strong> Build your vending machine empire making sure to choose the right product based on the demand and unlock high traffic locations like the International Airport! Stock machines with drinks, snacks, ice cream, and fast food, then watch pixel customers make purchases. Upgrade for bigger storage and full automation, monitor demand, adjust prices in real-time, and expand to premium city locations to maximize profits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize your machines with unique colors and become the ultimate vending tycoon!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83c\udfae  Demo Content:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>3 vending machines</strong> (vs unlimited in full version)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>2 product types</strong> (vs 10+ in full version)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>1 city area</strong> (vs multiple locations including Airport in full version)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Twitch Integration</strong> included!</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3741360?t=1748287240","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3741360/60061b229c21a1d11794fb1b4da126b74cbda197/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748287240","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3741360/b1e85cfb65b65cd0fdbbd1defce9a3b6e73d1c47/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748287240","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3741360/b1e85cfb65b65cd0fdbbd1defce9a3b6e73d1c47/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748287240","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3741360/extras/Gameplay-1.gif?t=1748287240\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Tiny Vending Machines</strong> is an idle pixel art business sim that runs discreetly at the bottom of your screen while you work, study, or browse. Build your vending empire without interrupting your day!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>How it works:</strong> Build your vending machine empire making sure to choose the right product based on the demand and unlock high traffic locations like the International Airport! Stock machines with drinks, snacks, ice cream, and fast food, then watch pixel customers make purchases. Upgrade for bigger storage and full automation, monitor demand, adjust prices in real-time, and expand to premium city locations to maximize profits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize your machines with unique colors and become the ultimate vending tycoon!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83c\udfae  Demo Content:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>3 vending machines</strong> (vs unlimited in full version)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>2 product types</strong> (vs 10+ in full version)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>1 city area</strong> (vs multiple locations including Airport in full version)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Twitch Integration</strong> included!</p></li></ul>","developers":["Frozen Logic Studios"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3595460","name":"Tiny Vending Machines"},"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"descripti